CHALLENGER verifies:
For each shared table, attempt to find a module that does NOT
appear in module-table-map.json but accesses the table via
dynamic query construction:
Terminal: grep -rn ‘”{table_name}”’ {module.path}   
–include=”*.java” –include=”*.kt” –include=”*.cs”   
–include=”*.rs” | grep -v test | grep -v .git
