STEP 3.5 — Foreign Key Boundary Analysis

Read schema.json.
For each foreign key relationship:
Determine which module owns the parent table.
Determine which module owns the child table.
IF different modules own parent and child:
→ Cross-service foreign key detected
→ Extraction will break referential integrity
→ Must be resolved: either move to application-level integrity
or keep both modules in same service

Write .migration/db/fk-boundaries.json with all cross-module FK relationships.

